  "body": "Named after the Irish word Cill Airne—meaning “the church by the sloe trees”—Killarney carries a sense of warmth, character, and timeless charm. At 65B Killarney Street, that same spirit is reflected in a collection of beautifully crafted, brand-new homes in the vibrant heart of Takapuna.\r\n\r\nArchitectural Excellence Over Three Levels\r\n\r\nThese contemporary residences offer a masterfully designed three-level layout, striking the perfect balance between social connectivity and private retreat. Featuring 4 spacious bedrooms, 3.5 designer bathrooms, and double internal-access garaging, every inch of this home has been executed with precision.\r\n\r\n• Ground Floor Versatility: The entry level features a private master suite situated alongside the garage. This secluded space is ideal for hosting guests, accommodating extended family, or providing the ultimate professional work-from-home flexibility.\r\n\r\n• The Social Hub: The second floor is dedicated to sophisticated open-plan living. A modern designer kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining and lounge areas, complemented by a guest powder room for added convenience when entertaining.\r\n\r\n• The Family Sanctuary: The upper level serves as a quiet haven, featuring a second luxurious master suite, two additional double bedrooms, and a stylish full family bathroom.\r\n\r\nA Location Second to None: Positioned in one of Takapuna’s most desirable coastal pockets, you are perfectly placed to enjoy the very best of North Shore living. Walk to the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, explore vibrant local cafés and boutique shopping, or enjoy easy access to major transport links.\r\n\r\nFor families, the educational pedigree is unmatched, with zoning for the region's top schools: Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls’ High School, and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nQuality You Can Trust: Combining contemporary elegance with a functional family lifestyle, these homes offer an exceptional living experience. Complete with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, buyers can secure their future with absolute confidence and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nElevate your lifestyle at 65B Killarney Street—where timeless charm meets modern luxury.",
